  <item>
    <title>Door County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/door-county-wi</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-door-county-wi</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>1-year moratorium on data centers and battery energy storage in unincorporated areas; board retains option to extend</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Marathon County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/marathon-county-wi</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-marathon-county-wi</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Marathon County Board adopted 12-month moratorium in late August 2026. Applies to 18 townships under county jurisdiction. Does not apply to existing data centers or facilities under 5,000 sq ft. Blocks new conditional use permits, zoning changes, and zoning permits.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Middleton: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/middleton-wi</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-middleton-wi</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>City of Middleton Common Council adopted data center moratorium as of Jul 1, 2026. Pauses issuance of zoning certificates for data centers. Planning department directed to draft comprehensive data center ordinance.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Winnebago County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/winnebago-county-wi</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-winnebago-county-wi</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>County Board passed 12-month moratorium in voice vote at Aug 18, 2026 meeting. Applies to townships of Algoma, Neenah, Nekimi, and Omro. Cities must adopt own regulations. Preemptive — no known data center proposals in county.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Green County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/green-county-wi</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-green-county-wi</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Board voted 30-1 to approve 12-month moratorium. No data center proposals had been received. Chairman Jerry Guth said moratorium would allow time to review and update antiquated zoning codes. Part of broader Wisconsin trend (~24 communities with moratoriums).</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Polk County: data center moratorium — Proposed</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/polk-county-wi</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-polk-county-wi</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>ESC approved resolution 29-26 on July 15 and sent to full county board for July 21 meeting. Residents providing public comment unanimously opposed data centers. Applies to 16 named towns. Final board vote outcome not confirmed in available sources.</description>
  </item>
